story += [P('3. Personalized recommendations','H1X'), P('The Recommendations page asks for a customer, shows their delivered purchase history, and suggests products they have not bought. It supports both the legacy UCI schema and Olist. Olist suggestions display product IDs and translated category names because the public catalog does not provide human-readable product titles.','BodyX'), P('How it ranks suggestions','H2X'), bullet('Builds a set of delivered products for the selected customer and for other customers.'), bullet('Measures product-history overlap with Jaccard similarity: shared products divided by the union of the two product sets.'), bullet('Considers up to 100 nearest overlapping customers; unseen products are scored using the sum of neighbor similarities.'), bullet('If peer-based candidates are unavailable, falls back to popular delivered products that the selected customer has not purchased.'), bullet('Explains peer-based recommendations with the number of similar customers that purchased the product; fallback recommendations are marked as popular items.')]
